{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01197",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.56,
      "end_seconds": 4.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Come in, have a seat by the desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.94,
      "end_seconds": 7.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Hi, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.4,
      "end_seconds": 12.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.61,
      "end_seconds": 17.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 18.39,
      "end_seconds": 23.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Actually, we came because of scaly red plaques on my elbows."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.62,
      "end_seconds": 28.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "So, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.44,
      "end_seconds": 32.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "For one week, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.58,
      "end_seconds": 44.09,
      "duration_seconds": 11.51,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.43,
      "end_seconds": 50.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Severe, really. It's worse with stress. Moisturiser helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.91,
      "end_seconds": 54.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "What about pitted nails, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.3,
      "end_seconds": 57.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Yes, for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.0,
      "end_seconds": 61.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "What about itching, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.51,
      "end_seconds": 64.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.79,
      "end_seconds": 68.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.48,
      "end_seconds": 74.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.78,
      "end_seconds": 75.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.99,
      "end_seconds": 88.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Any pus, joint pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.86,
      "end_seconds": 92.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.25,
      "end_seconds": 96.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.08,
      "end_seconds": 99.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.26,
      "end_seconds": 103.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.54,
      "end_seconds": 107.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.14,
      "end_seconds": 112.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.44,
      "end_seconds": 115.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.33,
      "end_seconds": 120.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.99,
      "end_seconds": 124.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.04,
      "end_seconds": 127.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.53,
      "end_seconds": 136.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.14,
      "end_seconds": 138.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.41,
      "end_seconds": 141.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Yes, gout."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.44,
      "end_seconds": 147.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.02,
      "end_seconds": 153.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I had my tonsils removed as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.18,
      "end_seconds": 157.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Okay, how are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.53,
      "end_seconds": 162.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.24,
      "end_seconds": 166.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.89,
      "end_seconds": 172.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.08,
      "end_seconds": 176.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.69,
      "end_seconds": 181.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.32,
      "end_seconds": 199.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 201.07,
      "end_seconds": 213.82,
      "duration_seconds": 12.75,
      "text": "She is on Eltroxin, 100 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid, I give it to her. So, it's allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day for the gout, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.56,
      "end_seconds": 216.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 217.44,
      "end_seconds": 219.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "About a month now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.86,
      "end_seconds": 224.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.85,
      "end_seconds": 234.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.87,
      "end_seconds": 264.1,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, temperature is 36.7 degrees. And pulse 72, blood pressure 122 over 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.2,
      "end_seconds": 266.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.15,
      "end_seconds": 270.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.72,
      "end_seconds": 275.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.3,
      "end_seconds": 280.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.75,
      "end_seconds": 294.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "There are well-defined silvery plaques on both elbows and a few pits in the nails."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.45,
      "end_seconds": 298.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.92,
      "end_seconds": 321.52,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, it's hard to say. Plaque psoriasis is one possibility and eczema another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.28,
      "end_seconds": 326.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Actually, what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.52,
      "end_seconds": 359.67,
      "duration_seconds": 31.15,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's plaque psoriasis, and we'll watch how it goes. I'd like you to take calcipotriol and betamethasone, 50 micrograms/0.5 mg per g, once a day, four weeks. That's for psoriasis. Keep the skin well moisturised and avoid picking the plaques. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.45,
      "end_seconds": 381.77,
      "duration_seconds": 16.32,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if you get painful or swollen joints, call us the same day or go to emergency. Come back in four weeks. Okay, that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.86,
      "end_seconds": 389.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.6,
      "end_seconds": 391.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}